{"id": "EUVD-2026-77355", "enisaUuid": "2352620e-b39e-31fd-888b-d3141cb97111", "description": "Incorrect Authorization vulnerability in Apache Doris allows an authenticated user to bypass privilege checks and access data they are not authorized to read, resulting in unauthorized disclosure of information.\n\n\n\nThis issue affects Apache Doris: from 2.0.0 through 2.1.*, from 3.0.0 through 3.0.*, from 4.0.0 before 4.0.8, and from 4.1.0 before 4.1.4.\n\n\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to a fixed release (4.0.8 or 4.1.4), which fixes the issue.", "datePublished": "2026-09-14T10:00:20", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-14T19:38:35", "baseScore": 6.5, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:N", "references": ["https://lists.apache.org/thread/rp2gr6d7rb4y8slxh3fojmhb1rl5ms03"], "aliases": ["GHSA-r72p-xj9g-6pqm", "CVE-2026-68570"], "assigner": "apache", "epss": 0.38, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "962f4a56-fcd6-3fbb-8423-4bcf291bd6cd", "product": {"name": "Apache Doris", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "4.0.0 <4.0.8"}, {"id": "ac38a0d7-561f-3d7f-a24c-e74a86ca5f38", "product": {"name": "Apache Doris", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "4.1.0 <4.1.4"}, {"id": "c144341a-f0ca-3fea-a5f7-209b57631131", "product": {"name": "Apache Doris", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "3.0.0 \u22643.0.*"}, {"id": "fa0a4c92-d8b2-3bc5-9d49-61beb69e03db", "product": {"name": "Apache Doris", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "2.0.0 \u22642.1.*"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "4255e68c-c867-3155-aa1a-6b5734628732", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}], "isExploited": false}